und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=udn7BA97e8QQ7kNvwEwOWg1&_nc_oc=Adl3h0tFLclJGXb6u-Tj9UmK_ktc22K9TI6G1fe3GviM_0j_ggqvHciiELiSLGFuasI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw9EyLrVRrJQz1hFtuetlQWLb1HI8GlP78so8m1scaLng&oe=69B7F747"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3fFdk3lIdxoQ7kNvwHbtIKk&_nc_oc=AdmhHBmOLzcSapn_KtIzVjltTjwcUMQzFS0jhLQSIVnSDc6OiCqKSwzZlbC3m1aWVVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw1k8B6jpZAYiXlPcAsgoF8cTyN3-oJD3Ez3e0c28iXFg&oe=69B804FC"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O-iRi8GU5rQQ7kNvwHkyBKo&_nc_oc=AdnGaA2FLeEWNHNbj2ZssA_4zMRFhaq-VRQYpdpU3MSjcncwUHjPpUNk1EvDC1npuZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx7KWnMkD7clQnpq8u-Zq-ML5rkmN5JZXJE6_YRn19dRQ&oe=69B7F62B"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_4465469510707743650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RGydbHxjoRkQ7kNvwE2-aPf&_nc_oc=AdnhZo-dG1H_nvKfWdS6UECqx3iubJ-DalmvCe09NSSb0Uw0sk-thCqKbkvGtr4l2F4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculusc